  "summary_en": "EU Commission Regulation setting conditions under which manufacturers of certain medical devices (implantables' tools, fixed installed devices, stand-alone software) may supply instructions for use electronically instead of on paper, with risk assessment, paper-on-request, website and notified-body review requirements. Not about AI or robotics.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
